WEBVTT

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.230
Did I surprise you?

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:29.150
Jeez, Yumi...

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:29.520
Take that!

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.610
Summer is so great...

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.320
It's the time of the year when beautiful girls shine brightest.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:42.620
Sharks Have Been Spotted Here
Swimming Forbidden

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.290
Mio-tama!

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:52.170
I-I can't breathe-

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:55.930
What are you saying? This is only the start of your treatment.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:01:00.050
In order to cure your masochism, we need to teach your body

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:02.810
that there's a direct connection between life and the external factors of pain.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.890
But there are limits to the capabilities of humans.

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.520
In other words, up until now, our plans weren't enough.

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:11.020
Yes~.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:15.740
But if it's those bloodthirsty sharks, they should be able to do it!

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.110
Do it? Do what?

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:22.120
The Secondary Volunteering Club!
The Summer Special Training Camp!

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:25.540
Our goal is to cure Pig-Boy's masochism!

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.460
Today we shall actually succeed!

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:37.880
Help!!

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:47.230
Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu... YES!! Help U

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:53.400
Hey you lost boy, with a face full of despair

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.610
If you throw out the straw you're leaning on,

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:58.650
I guess that can't be helped either?

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:00.950
Fate is (straying away)

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:03.120
Being mean again today (going beserk)

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:09.000
At least I want to be on your side, but what can I do?

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.040
NO!! Jesus crisis! Oh My God!

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:14.130
Try leaving it to me

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.260
YES!! Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu Help U

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:18.550
Just getting there is too weak,

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:21.140
get destroyed to nothing and then?

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:25.810
DNA is stubborn. Overdoing isn't allowed.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:28.180
With 5 seconds remaining I ended it forcefully (right before)

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.390
Feeling like getting reborn? (no way)

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:35.190
If we do the hands-on-approach rehab; you'll go to HEAVEN

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.530
Without even letting you say yes

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:39.820
With these hands

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:43.700
I'll fix you up right away

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:48.290
A little fall in love feeling bigger than your presence is

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:53.210
making me unable to leave you alone with that miserable face.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:57.420
I made it a meeting to change your outlook on life.

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:02.510
So just start going along with the flow

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:05.600
I'm off to HELP YOU!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.980
A Midsummer's Love Triangle?

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:21.700
I wonder if Tarou's all right...

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.410
Not... there...!

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.620
I'm not going to let you say no.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.330
How about here?

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.000
No... please stop...

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.500
Honestly Arashiko, you're so adorable.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:38.300
I also...

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.670
Amazing.
I... I...

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:41.260
Keep it up, Mamiya Yumi.

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:41.880
I can't stop this... I can't stop!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.260
Next, do this move on Mio!

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.220
The sharks aren't coming out!

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:51.230
Hot! Oh, the hot sand and Mio-tama's foot!

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.020
Oh it's hot! Hot! Hot!
Is that sign a fraud or something?

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:58.940
We even went through the trouble of renting this boat for you. Useless sharks!

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:00.690
Tarou...

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.610
What's up with that freak?

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.410
I'm getting chills from witnessing such a disgusting sight.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:08.370
Please, step on me more...

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:11.120
The treatment has only just begun.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.330
Next...

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:16.330
These guys will fix Pig-Boy's masochism!

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:18.670
Huh...?

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:21.510
Uhm... What's the logic behind that?

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:25.630
Your masochism reacts to pain caused by females.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:28.640
So then, what if the violence were done by crabs?

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.760
Excuse me...?

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:35.560
See? Your masochism doesn't occur from pain caused by crabs.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.770
We're going to use these to drain the masochism out.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.650
Don't you think it's a perfect plan?

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.070
No, I don't.

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:43.400
Really, this thing doesn't even hurt very much.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:46.530
Maybe crabs this small don't have any effect...

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:48.370
Then we should go by quantity.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:51.870
How sensitive he is to pain may vary, depending on which body part it is.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:54.250
Then you guys help me out.

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:54.830
But...

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.880
There's no need to directly get in contact with Pig-Boy, so there's no worries, right?

00:04:59.250 --> 00:04:59.880
Yeah...

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.340
This really is a sickening club.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.880
But I guess I'll help you out with this.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.260
If we're going for the painful areas, it would be here, there...

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:15.560
Ah... It hurts...

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.440
But what's this sensation...?

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.520
This might be bad...

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:20.310
Plus...

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:23.070
You getting this? These are done by crabs.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.450
It's not what I'm doing, they're all done by crabs.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:29.200
It's the crab's fault! You perv!

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:33.200
So if it's not the babes doing it to me...

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:36.910
I-I'm starting to feel energized!

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:40.420
More crabs! Please give me more crabs!

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.210
Crabs! Crabs! Crabs! Crabs! Crabs!

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:44.590
Please! I'm begging you!

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.090
Oh god... Another failure...

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:47.470
Please! I'm begging you!

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.260
Then, we're moving onto our next plan!

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.770
Yeah, I came along too.

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:01.190
The Secondary Volunteering Club Style, "Smash the Watermelon" competition!

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:04.650
The watermelon is over there. Now go crack it open!

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:05.440
Okay!

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:11.120
Masochism is a special propensity that only humans have.

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:13.660
So if you quit being human, you're released from it.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.790
Now, experience the end of your miserable life while playing the role of an insignificant watermelon!

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:29.300
I-I'm only a watermelon right now!

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:30.930
I'm not a man!

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:33.350
No! Men scare me!

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.430
They're scary! Scary! Scary! Scary! Scary! Scary!

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:36.560
I'm so scared!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.560
I'm just a miserable watermelon!

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:40.770
Break me up more!

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.310
Crack me open!

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.110
So this plan is another failure...

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:52.160
Being called out by Michiru-sensei... And finding out that it's a camp for the Secondary Volunteering Club...?

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:52.780
On top of that...

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.030
Tatsukichi-kun!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.580
Even Yumi's here.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.620
The fried noodles were delicious.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.040
Oh, were they?

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:05.130
Next time... I want you to teach me how to make them...

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:07.800
Th-They're just normal fried noodles.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:14.260
Really? But... It was the first time that I've had such delicious fried noodles.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.720
Wh-What do you want...?

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.980
I think... actually...

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:24.360
I still...

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.280
Look at that! There!

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:32.780
Arashiko?

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:35.740
Hey.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:40.870
It turned out this way because you said you wanted a boat ride, but...

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:41.960
Was it okay?

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:43.170
What do you mean?

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:45.540
I mean... being with a guy like me.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.510
It's fine, because I'm...

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:03.140
HEY! SADO TAROU!

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:07.400
Get away from Arashiko! You disgusting, masochistic pervert!

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:11.650
Just go sink and never float back up again, you piece of shit!

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:14.030
A-Awesome...

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:17.280
Hey.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.490
Apparently there's a summer festival at the shrine tonight.

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:21.790
Oh yeah, so I've heard.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.290
I'm really looking forward to it. I want to eat some cotton candy!

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:26.920
Cotton candy, eh?

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.290
The last time I had it, I was really young.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:32.340
Really? Th-Then...

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.380
Do you want to have some tonight... with me...?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.980
Nooooo! Men are scary!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.650
Scary! Scary! Scary! Scary! Scary! Scary!

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:52.360
Somehow I feel like it's not really the appropriate time to be doing this, but this is fine too!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.070
S-Seriously?!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:56.160
You appear now? You stupid shark!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:58.660
I'm going to slice it into three pieces if it does anything to Arashiko!

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:01.330
That's not... a real shark.

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:02.540
Say what?

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:04.120
What's that supposed to mean?

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.710
Ow...

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:12.210
What was that?

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:35.360
Hiiragi-san?!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.540
Why did you bring us here...?

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.170
Sado-kun... You promised...

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.420
Huh?

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:59.050
Do you... remember the promise?

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.970
You promised that you'd play with me lots.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.850
<i>I'll join you if you don't mind, Hiiragi-san!</i>

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:13.230
<i>Let's do all the things you've ever wanted to do.</i>

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:15.570
<i>Let's do "normal stuff" together.</i>

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:25.240
That's why I'm going to play with Sado-kun today.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.200
Right, so that's why you did all thi-

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.410
No!

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.370
Tarou's participating in a summer camp for club activities right now!

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:34.380
You are the one called Yuuno Arashiko...

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:37.380
Yes I am. I come from the same junior high as Tarou...

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.760
I'm in the same class and club...

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:43.390
I've dined at his place with his family...

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.890
Been in his room before...!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:50.440
And I've even been to the zoo with him alone. That's me, Yuuno Arashiko!

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.860
You're pissing me off for some reason...

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:58.400
Noa didn't imagine that such an annoying bug would ever come along...

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:01.950
Tarou, let's just ignore this thing and head back.

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:04.370
Sado-kun is going to play with Noa!

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:07.490
No way. Tarou is going back with me.

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:09.120
He's going to play with Noa!

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.250
Let's all play together!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.420
I'm sure it's more fun playing together as three than as two.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:15.750
Eh?!

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:18.130
So, what do you want to play?

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:19.510
Idea!

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:20.840
Let's play house!

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:23.300
House? Here?

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.640
That's right!

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:27.310
Button press.

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:37.110
Eh?!

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:37.940
What on earth...

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.110
is this?

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.860
This is what Noa made, a special play house!

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:44.780
Now we'll begin!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.370
Sado-kun is the father,

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:48.620
and Noa is the mother.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.200
You roleplay as the daughter.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.080
Objection!

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:58.460
Hiiragi-san doesn't seem very motherly, so I think it's better if I be his wife.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:01.840
Noa's going to be Sado-kun's wife!

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:04.130
That's too unrealistic!

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:07.010
A <i>childish</i>  role suits you better.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.430
A <i>childish</i>  role...?

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:13.190
Did you just call me a <i>child?</i>

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:16.980
Hey, hey... We'll decide fair and square with rock-paper-scissors.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:20.070
Okay? So, whoever wins is the mother.

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:23.490
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:25.610
Awesome!

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:27.030
Yay, yay!

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:36.790
Darling!

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:39.750
It's morning already, wake up!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.920
Oh gosh! I said darling!

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:43.220
Good morning, Yuuno.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:46.930
Honestly. There's no calling your wife 'Yuuno' right?

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:48.510
Oh... Right.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:50.100
So... Okay?

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.010
Yeah...

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:54.020
A-Arashiko...

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:59.770
Call me Arashiko properly, okay? Darling.

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.440
O-Okay...

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.690
Good morning, Arashik-

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:06.860
Tarou! My beloved darling!

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:09.280
I missed you so much!

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:10.080
What?!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.950
Hello ma'am, it's nice to meet you.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.960
I'm Noa, the person Tarou's been cheating on you with.

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:18.960
Hey! I thought you were playing the daughter!

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:23.210
Noa did lose against you and had to forfeit the role as his wife...

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:26.680
But! I never said anything about playing the role of the daughter.

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:30.600
Well then, let us continue.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:34.180
Tarou and Noa have been sleeping together.

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:36.230
Yes! Since three years ago!

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.560
What?! Th-Three years?

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:41.480
What's this supposed to mean, darling? Explain yourself!

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:43.940
What? Well how am I supposed to...

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:44.860
Tarou was...

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:50.700
troubled for a very long time as a result of your extreme violence, ma'am.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:53.240
What?! My violence?

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.330
Yes! This is the evidence!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:14:01.670
No! No! No! No! Scary! Scary! Scary! Scary! Men are scary!

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:05.130
Tarou was no longer able to cope with the stress and searched for a place of healing.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.880
That's when he found the oasis that is me, Noa!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:09.470
That's all made up!

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:10.970
Oh you think so?

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:13.470
Then go gently touch him now.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.930
But, that's...

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:17.810
So you can't do it.

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:22.860
You're only able to communicate with your husband through violence!

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:25.070
Can you really call that husband and wife?

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:28.110
Yuuno...

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.490
Maybe you're saying a bit too much...

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:36.750
Hiiragi-san! We're husband and wife, so touching is no problem!

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:38.710
Y-Yuuno!

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:43.210
Nooooooo!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.130
That's cruel!

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:48.470
I'm against domestic violence!

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:52.550
O-Oh really? My husband is looking quite pleased there.

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:52.970
What?

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:59.770
Tarou is a total pervert that enjoys pain!

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:06.610
A hella masochist that loves to be punched by his wife!

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:10.610
This isn't violence. It's just another way that a husband and wife are.

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:14.910
Hey you! You're just admitting to the fact that you're a perverted sadist-masochist couple!

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:16.740
Don't you have any shame?!

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:17.990
I don't mind.

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:21.710
Because... no matter how much of a creepy husband he is...

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:28.170
I still love him!

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.720
I feel as if extremely terrible things are being said about me...

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:33.430
Hey, wait!

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:35.180
What?!

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:37.470
Wh-Why...?

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:41.690
What's happening here...?

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:47.940
Why are you guys here?

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:52.240
We followed after you were kidnapped by the mysterious shark mecha.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.490
What are you doing anyway? It looks fun.

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:57.580
Playing house at the age of high-schoolers makes me wonder, but...

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:00.620
It looks fun, so allow us to join.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:01.620
And who are you?

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.960
I'm just a princess passing by.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:08.920
Wait a moment there! I never planned for this outcome!

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:11.720
I'm going to be Tarou's childhood friend.

